{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53722","headline":"答复礼禅师《真妄偈》（题拟） 一 · 宗密","name":"答复礼禅师《真妄偈》（题拟） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"本净本不觉，由斯妄念起。\n知真妄即空，知空妄即止。\n止处名有终，迷时号无始。\n因缘如幻梦，何终复何始？\n此是衆生源，穷之出生死。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宗密","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53722.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53722","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}